    {
      "id": 214714,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-02-24T00:56:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After this, what's left to cover? I'm sure someone's been keeping track of what heroes, villains and environments they've gone over to date...</p><p>Okay, so I loved all the Pokemon banter. :D But the one thing that stood out? \"An Oblivaeon episode.\"</p><p><em>An</em></p><p>As in \"there will be more than one\". :D That's something to get excited about!</p><p>Or else Christopher just misspoke. :B But what are fandoms if not accelerators of bad ideas?</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
