      "created_at": "2018-02-25T18:58:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had a couple thoughts on this EN, but I can't remember everything. Maybe I'll relisten to get a reminder.</p><p>What I do remember: I want that list of cryptids. That's good fuel for my RPG character.</p><p>And it looks like the end is pretty near, at least for the episodes covering deck characters/environments.</p><p>I would consider donatiing to a patreon for the podcast, but I'm both wary of things that auto-take money from my account(I always pay bills in cash when it's possible) and I want to wait to see what their pledge levels are.</p>",
